{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Do not turn to the ghosts.</b> Do not turn toward them, but turn your back and not your face. It goes without saying that you shall not honor them." "<b>Do not seek to be defiled by them.</b> Do not seek them in order to become defiled by them, but seek to know their nature so as to give instruction, as they said, of blessed memory: לֹא תִלְמַד לַעֲשׂוֹת (Deuteronomy 18:9) — 'but you may learn to understand and to give instruction' (Shabbat 75a)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:01.060919330Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}